{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/pratap-heritage/120415/project","title":"Pratap Heritage, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"# Pratap Heritage Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## Pratap Heritage Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price Trends\n\nPratap Heritage's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Pratap Heritage | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 25600 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 25400 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 25200 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nPratap Heritage avg. price is ₹ 25.6 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Avenue](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-avenue/121114/project \"Kalpataru Avenue\") | ₹ 40,900 |\n| [Chandak Gokarna](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-gokarna/62086/project \"Chandak Gokarna\") | ₹ 31,900 |\n| [Mayfair Sardar Smruti CHS](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-sardar-smruti-chs/150818/project \"Mayfair Sardar Smruti CHS\") | ₹ 31,650 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| Current Project **Pratap Heritage** | ₹ 25,600 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Pratap Heritage | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Pratap Heritage.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Pratap Heritage, amounting to ₹ 4 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### Thane Infrastructure and Development Updates\n\nThe Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel project saw the launch of TBM Arjuna on August 13, 2026, aiming to reduce travel time between Thane and Borivali to approximately 15 minutes. Amazon Data Services is developing a large data center in Ambernath, with an estimated construction cost of ₹3,500 crore, to be ready by 2029\n\n#### Mumbai Boosts Connectivity with Santacruz - Chembur link road Phase 2 & Chembur Metro Station\n\nCM Devendra Fadnavis inaugurated Phase 2 of the Santacruz-Chembur Link Road (SCLR) & the Chembur Metro Station under Metro Line 2B,The SCLR Phase 2 is expected to strengthen the road network between Mumbai's western and eastern suburbs, improving east-west connectivity.\n\n#### Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel Project: Traffic Diversions Announced in Kasarvadavali\n\nTemporary traffic diversions have been implemented in Kasarvadavali for the ongoing work on the ambitious Thane-Borivali twin tunnel project by the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA). Certain routes will be closed from July 6 to August 5, 2026, to facilitate construction.\n\n#### Mumbai Monorail Services to Resume After Nine-Month Hiatus\n\nMumbai's monorail services are set to resume soon after a nine-month suspension, following approval from the Maharashtra government for safety improvements and fare revisions. MMRDA has proposed increased ticket prices. The monorail, which previously carried around 18,000 passengers daily, will offer improved services after safety upgrades.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Pratap Heritage moved from ₹ 25,400/sqft to ₹ 25,600/sqft, reflecting a 0.79% rise.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### MMRDA to Launch Metro Lines 2B and 9, Bhoomipujan for Thane-Borivali Tunnel and BKC Pod Taxi on April 7\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) will inaugurate Metro Line 2B (Phase I) and Metro Line 9 (Phase I), and conduct the bhoomipujan for the Thane–Borivali Twin Tunnel project and the pod taxi system in Bandra Kurla Complex (BKC) on April 7. These projects aim to significantly reduce travel time, ease congestion, and improve connectivity across Mumbai's suburbs.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Pratap Heritage moved from ₹ 25,200/sqft to ₹ 25,400/sqft, reflecting a 0.79% rise.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Pratap Heritage From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 30.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 4 Cr | ₹ 30,750 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Pratap Heritage\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Pratap Heritage.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Mk High School\n\n#### Govind Nagar Junction\n\n#### Raj Jyoti Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Pratap Heritage\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Pratap Heritage From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 30.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-06-04 | Floor 10, Unit 1001 | B | 1,390 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Pratap Heritage compare with similar projects?\n\n![Pratap Heritage project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-pratap-heritage-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Pratap Heritage](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/pratap-heritage/120415/project \"Pratap Heritage\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ajmera Yogi Sant project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-yogi-sant-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Ajmera Yogi Sant](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-yogi-san