jpg)\n![Chandak](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chandak-1050.jpg)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg)\n![Shapoorji Pallonji](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/shapoorji-pallonji-494.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Vian](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vian-project-project-large-image1-5543-opt-460392f9-2d11-4a1c-b830-fba5e810b682.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Ahana](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-ahana-project-project-large-image1-4621-opt-3fdf8c3f-c784-42fd-b0f5-4398c6901234.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Purva Estrella](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/purva-estrella-project-project-large-image1-3989-opt-3a6c3ad5-4526-45bf-b146-a3e451ce03ed.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Adani Linkbay Residences](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/adani-linkbay-residences-project-project-large-image1-2560.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Rainforest](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-rainforest-project-project-large-image1-5108-opt-1de55a7d-9847-4c14-bd04-8125e6d5a57d.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Meadows](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-meadows-project-project-large-image1-8749-opt-0576b543-8352-4304-ab97-6c63b05f3057.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![GHP Mars Suncity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/jpv-pratap-adinath-borivali-west-pid-15720","title":"JPV Pratap Adinath in Borivali West, Mumbai - Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Location","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-borivali-west)\n10. /\n11. JPV Pratap Adinath\n\n# JPV Pratap Adinath\n\nFlats by **[JPV Realtors](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-jpv-realtors)** at Pratap Adinath By Inspira Realty, Borivali, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800050861\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR1.6 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR1.6 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2027\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area449 - 1,009\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 35.63 K per Sqft.\n\n[![JPV Pratap Adinath Floor Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/files/5549/original/floorplan1.JPG?1706363071)\n\n[![JPV Pratap Adinath Floor Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/files/5550/original/floorplan2.JPG?1706363071)\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800050861\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DQmIU7lDF5Z","title":"Devidas Lane, Borivali West* Project Info. : *Stilt+P1+P2+P3+P4+17 ...","raw_content":"[Log In](/accounts/login/?next=%2Freel%2FDQmIU7lDF5Z&source=desktop_nav)\n\n[Sign Up](/accounts/emailsignup/)\n\nNever miss a post from hiltonrealtors01\n\nSign up for Instagram to stay in the loop.\n\n[Sign up](/accounts/emailsignup/)\n\n[Log in](/accounts/login/?source=desktop_dynamic_landing_dialog)\n\n![](https://scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/573049606_2125286864949458_1569471619309993938_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fYWRkaXRpb25hbF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=LrkdyLI33X0Q7kNvwGKOvxR&_nc_oc=AdrhKhXC5ZI0CI1QVZqMqP_W8hkZ303wpQBwc450ZHiI7Kdh4Ma5J2R2v9DeZ9HBAFI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=ZH0bXkqMi9mc8oXPTVN-2g&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQKrEYT2PmxTiFRlqMG4biLH8-hZQ9WTcBW4mehqfzZ0bw&oe=6AA5BE0E)\n\n[hiltonrealtors01](/hiltonrealtors01/) and [4 others](#)\n\n---\n\n[hiltonrealtors01](/hiltonrealtors01/)\n\n\\*💥KING SIZE 2 BHK WITH BALCONY💥\\*   \n  \nRERA NO. : \\*Rera No. P51800054886   \n  \n📍Location : \\*Devidas Lane, Borivali West\\*   \n  \n🏬 Project Info. : \\*Stilt+P1+P2+P3+P4+17 Storied\\*   \n  \nPossession : Builder Dec. 2026 / As per Rera Dec. 2027 \\*   \n  \n \\*¤Amenities¤\\*   \n   \n☆Exclusive Double Height Designer Entrance Lobby   \n☆ Ample Car Parking space in Stilt & 4 Level Podium with 2 way Ramp  \n☆ Roof top amenities   \n☆ Fully Equipped Fitness Center   \n☆ Meditation Area and Yoga Zone  \n  \n \\*¤Configuration Details¤\\*   \n  \n \\*● 2 BHK 821 Sq. Ft. (RERA Carpet)\\*   \n \\*JODI POSSIBLE\\*   \n  \n \\*● 2 BHK 706 Sq. Ft. (RERA Carpet)\\*   \n  \n \\*● 2 BHK 679 Sq. Ft. (RERA Carpet)\\*   \n  \n \\*Nearby Vicinity\\*   \n  \nLink Road: 2 Minutes  \nMetro Station: 3 Minutes   \nW.E. Highway: 10 Minutes  \nSV Road: 4 Minutes  \nBorivali Railway Station: 7 Minutes  \n  \nFor more details please contact to team   \n  \nHilton Realtors   \nRoshan Bahare :- 9833728791  \nKisan Jadhav :- 9372341771  \nArbaaz Shaikh :- 8779148607  \nVijay Mukhi :- 9820486656  \n  \n[#hiltonrealtors](/explore/tags/hiltonrealtors/) [#realtors](/explore/tags/realtors/) [#realty](/explore/tags/realty/) [#realestate](/explore/tags/realestate/) [#property](/explore/tags/property/) [#propertyforsale](/explore/tags/propertyforsale/) [#newproject](/explore/tags/newproject/) [#spacious](/explore/tags/spacious/) [#2bhk](/explore/tags/2bhk/) [#balcony](/explore/tags/balcony/) [#primelocation](/explore/tags/primelocation/) [#metrostation](/explore/tags/metrostation/) [#viral](/explore/tags/viral/) [#instagram](/explore/tags/instagram/) [#reels](/explore/tags/reels/) [#reelsindia](/explore/tags/reelsindia/) [#dreamhome](/explore/tags/dreamhome/) [#investment](/explore/tags/investment/) [#mumbai](/explore/tags/mumbai/) [#borivali](/explore/tags/borivali/)\n\n[adsure\\_patil](/adsure_patil/)\n\nDo you have 1 BHK ?\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\n[vivekgupta\\_up\\_62\\_lover](/vivekgupta_up_62_lover/)\n\n❤️❤️❤️❤️\n\n1 like\n\nReply\n\n574\n\n[Log in](/accounts/login/?next=%2Freel%2FDQmIU7lDF5Z&source=post_comment_input) to like or comment.\n\n---\n\nMore posts from [hiltonrealtors01](/hiltonrealtors01/)\n\n[![Video by Vijay Mukhi on November 13, 2024.](https://scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.75761-15/466372078_